6 0 obj
<< /Length 2770 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (1. A defect in tc-agg 2.31.0 caused consumers to stop acknowledging messages without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (   crashing, so no health check failed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (2. The tessera.agg queue had no length limit or dead-letter policy, so one stalled consumer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (   could consume broker memory without bound.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 677 Td (3. RabbitMQ memory alarms block publishers cluster-wide, coupling ingestion to the health of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 664 Td (   every downstream consumer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 651 Td (4. Gateway firmware 4.x reconnected immediately and replayed buffers without pacing, turning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 638 Td (   recovery into a second overload.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 625 Td (5. The failover runbook had no check of broker queue depth, so responders spent time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 612 Td (   evaluating a failover that would not have helped.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 596 Td (Action items) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 575 Td (ID | Action | Owner | Due | Status) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 563 Td (AI-1 | Set x-max-length and a dead-letter exchange on all TesseraCloud queues | Hannah Osei |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 551 Td (2024-05-31 | Done) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 539 Td (AI-2 | Add a broker queue-depth check to the TesseraCloud Regional Failover Runbook before any) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 527 Td (failover decision \(added as step 9; converted to a Kafka consumer-lag check after ADR-019\) |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 515 Td (Piotr Zielinski | 2024-06-28 | Done) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 503 Td (AI-3 | Add jittered reconnect backoff and paced buffer replay to the TS-4 gateway firmware so) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 491 Td (gateways do not all reconnect at once after an outage | Tessera firmware team | 2024-09-30 |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 479 Td (Done \(gateway firmware 5.0.0 released 9 September 2024\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 467 Td (AI-4 | Evaluate a broker that supports replay and does not block publishers when a consumer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 455 Td (stalls | Kofi Mensah-Bonsu | 2024-09-15 | Done \(resulted in ADR-019, Kafka\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 443 Td (AI-5 | Alert when a consumer's acknowledgement rate drops to zero for 3 minutes | Ravi) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 431 Td (Chandrasekar | 2024-06-14 | Done) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 419 Td (AI-6 | Add a canary stage for tc-agg deployments in Forge \(10% of consumers for 15 minutes\) |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 407 Td (Ellie Brannigan | 2024-07-31 | Done) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 382 Td (Lessons) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 360 Td (A consumer that stops working silently is harder to detect than one that crashes. Back-pressure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347 Td (design must prevent one consumer from stopping ingestion for every customer.) Tj ET
endstream
